## Integration acceptance

- Check the new-installation and restore routes, with no companion branding on any sign-in screen.
- Check that the discovered, configuring, configured-without-state and rejected-authorisation examples keep their different meanings.
- Confirm that the examples contain no real credentials and never link to a fake sign-in page.

Record the actual environment, versions, state, method and result using [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). A source review or a local example does not show physical behaviour, screen-reader use or live compatibility.
